<title>USA: Paxson Comms to buy 3 Fla radio stations.</title>
<headline>Paxson Comms to buy 3 Fla radio stations.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paxson Communications Corp said Tuesday it plans to acquire three radio stations from Key Chain Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Paxson will buy WFKZ-FM, serving Key Largo and the Upper Keys, WAVK-FM serving Marathon and the middle Keys, and WKRY-FM serving Key West and the lower Keys.</p>
</text>
